│ patch_description        │ The editable parameters are the nine independent RY amplitudes, seven effective RZ phase  │
│                          │ parameters due to sharing on wires (1,4) and (5,6), and the interaction topology.         │
│                          │ Training-loop settings such as learning rate and iteration count are fixed externally.    │
│                          │ This version preserves the current 16-parameter budget and gate count but replaces the    │
│                          │ fixed CZ(3,5) edge with a trainable ZZZ interaction on the symmetry-connected triad       │
│                          │ (1,3,8). The targeted higher-order correlation increases expressivity without adding      │
│                          │ depth through an extra gate or worsening parameter efficiency, while the existing phase   │
│                          │ sharing continues to regularize peripheral qubits.                                        │
