╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ shared_dual_rotation_layer                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Regularize the initial RY layer using the graph-symmetry sharing pattern that previously  │
│                          │ improved validation accuracy, then reorder the commuting CZ gates into disjoint matchings │
│                          │ to expose parallel execution. Append a second RY→RZ layer after entanglement to provide a │
│                          │ trainable output basis and greater nonlinear expressivity. The second RY layer uses the   │
