│ patch_description        │ This compact ansatz retains the strongest low-depth structure from prior trials: shared   │
│                          │ RY parameters regularize graph-related qubits, independent RZ phases preserve local       │
│                          │ discrimination, and the pairwise interactions are scheduled as disjoint matchings. The    │
