│ patch_description        │ This design retains the graph-complete entanglement pattern that performed best in prior  │
│                          │ candidates while avoiding the parameter cost of a full second Euler layer. The fixed CZ   │
│                          │ on edge [3,5] is replaced by the recommended trainable CRX interaction, introducing an    │
│                          │ orthogonal conditional mixing channel. A shared post-entanglement RX layer then acts as a │
│                          │ compact basis-changing echo: across repeated blocks, RX follows the initial RY/RZ         │
│                          │ transformations and creates richer noncommuting dynamics. Graph-aware parameter sharing   │
│                          │ keeps the model regularized at 132 total parameters, midway between the compact and       │
│                          │ high-performing deep candidates.                                                          │
