│ patch_description        │ Insert a shared-parameter RX mixing layer after the second group of graph interactions.   │
│                          │ The noncommuting RX rotations break up the predominantly phase-oriented RZ/CZ/CRZ         │
│                          │ structure, allowing subsequent controlled interactions to transform phase correlations    │
│                          │ into measurable amplitude features. Parameters are tied across graph-related wire classes │
│                          │ to add only six independent parameters per repetition, limiting overfitting and depth     │
│                          │ overhead while improving expressivity.                                                    │
